        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કચેરી (kacerī) matches Hindi kacahrī, \"court-house\", which CDIAL traces to a reconstructed kṛtyagharikā, \"court-house\", built on kṛtya, \"business\", and ghara, \"house\" (CDIAL 3429). CDIAL lists no Gujarati form there."
            }
          ]
        },
